description: Do not use Cursor Fast mode for this agent or its subagents
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not use Cursor Fast mode.

Do not select Fast in the model picker. Do not pass `fast`, or any model slug that ends in `-fast`, when launching a subagent. Omit `model`, or set it to `inherit`, so the parent model is used. If a specific model is requested, use that model's non-fast slug.
